#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Describes how long a Qiskit Runtime job can run, regardless of what "
"execution mode is used."
msgstr ""
"Menjelaskan berapa lama job Qiskit Runtime bisa berjalan, terlepas dari mode"
" eksekusi yang digunakan."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maximum execution time for Qiskit Runtime workloads"
msgstr "Waktu eksekusi maksimum untuk workload Qiskit Runtime"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To ensure fairness, there is a [service-calculated](#max-QPU) maximum amount"
" of time each Qiskit Runtime job can run. If a job exceeds this time limit, "
"it is forcibly canceled and a `RuntimeJobMaxTimeoutError` exception is "
"raised. You can also [set a maximum execution time](#max-job) on your jobs "
"to help control costs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk memastikan keadilan, ada batas waktu maksimum yang dihitung oleh "
"layanan untuk setiap job Qiskit Runtime. Jika sebuah job melebihi batas "
"waktu ini, job tersebut akan dibatalkan secara paksa dan exception "
"`RuntimeJobMaxTimeoutError` akan dimunculkan. Kamu juga bisa [mengatur waktu"
" eksekusi maksimum](#max-job) pada job-mu untuk membantu mengontrol biaya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
" <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   The session or batch is immediately terminated when the cost limit is reached. Any jobs currently running in that session or batch will run to completion, but any pending jobs will be canceled.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
" <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   Session atau batch langsung dihentikan ketika batas biaya tercapai. Job apa pun yang sedang berjalan dalam session atau batch tersebut akan berjalan sampai selesai, tetapi job yang masih menunggu akan dibatalkan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"max-job\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"max-job\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set a maximum execution time {#set-a-maximum-execution-time}"
msgstr "Mengatur waktu eksekusi maksimum {#set-a-maximum-execution-time}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The maximum execution time for a job is the smaller of these values:\n"
msgstr "Waktu eksekusi maksimum untuk sebuah job adalah nilai terkecil dari:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The value set for `max_execution_time`\n"
msgstr "Nilai yang diatur untuk `max_execution_time`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The service-determined job timeout value\n"
msgstr "Nilai timeout job yang ditentukan oleh layanan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `max_execution_time` value is based on *QPU usage*, not wall clock "
"time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nilai `max_execution_time` didasarkan pada *penggunaan QPU*, bukan waktu jam"
" dinding.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set the maximum execution time (in seconds) on the job options, as shown in "
"the following example.  See the [Estimator options](/guides/estimator-"
"options), [Sampler options](/guides/sampler-options), or [Executor "
"options](/guides/executor-options) guides for information about setting "
"options.\n"
msgstr ""
"Atur waktu eksekusi maksimum (dalam detik) pada opsi job, seperti yang "
"ditunjukkan pada contoh berikut. Lihat panduan [Opsi "
"Estimator](/guides/estimator-options), [Opsi Sampler](/guides/sampler-"
"options), atau [Opsi Executor](/guides/executor-options) untuk informasi "
"tentang pengaturan opsi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also find how much usage completed jobs have consumed by returning "
"the job metrics as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu juga bisa mengetahui berapa banyak penggunaan yang telah dikonsumsi "
"oleh job yang sudah selesai dengan mengembalikan metrik job sebagai "
"berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"max-QPU\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"max-QPU\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Service-calculated maximum execution time {#service-calculated-maximum-"
"execution-time}"
msgstr ""
"Waktu eksekusi maksimum yang dihitung layanan {#service-calculated-maximum-"
"execution-time}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The service calculates an appropriate job timeout value based on the input "
"circuits and options. This service-calculated timeout is capped at 3 hours "
"to ensure fair device usage. If a `max_execution_time` is also specified for"
" the job, the lesser of the two values is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"Layanan menghitung nilai timeout job yang sesuai berdasarkan Circuit dan "
"opsi input. Timeout yang dihitung layanan ini dibatasi hingga 3 jam untuk "
"memastikan penggunaan perangkat yang adil. Jika `max_execution_time` juga "
"ditentukan untuk job tersebut, nilai yang lebih kecil dari keduanya yang "
"digunakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, if you specify `max_execution_time=5000` (approximately 83 "
"minutes), but the service determines it should not take more than 5 minutes "
"(300 seconds) to execute the job, then the job is canceled after 5 "
"minutes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Misalnya, jika kamu menentukan `max_execution_time=5000` (sekitar 83 menit),"
" tetapi layanan menentukan bahwa eksekusi job tidak boleh lebih dari 5 menit"
" (300 detik), maka job akan dibatalkan setelah 5 menit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"batch-max-time\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"batch-max-time\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Batch maximum execution time {#batch-maximum-execution-time}"
msgstr "Waktu eksekusi maksimum Batch {#batch-maximum-execution-time}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When a batch is started, it is assigned a maximum time to live (maximum TTL)"
" value. After this TTL is reached, the batch is terminated, any jobs that "
"are already running continue running, and any queued jobs that remain in the"
" batch are put into a failed state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ketika sebuah batch dimulai, batch tersebut diberi nilai time to live "
"maksimum (TTL maksimum). Setelah TTL ini tercapai, batch dihentikan, job "
"yang sudah berjalan akan terus berjalan, dan job yang masih antre dalam "
"batch akan dimasukkan ke status gagal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Batches also have an interactive time to live (interactive TTL) value "
"between jobs that cannot be configured. If you don't explicitly close a "
"batch, it is deactivated after the interactive TTL expires and can be "
"reactivated at any time until it reaches its  maximum TTL.\n"
msgstr ""
"Batch juga memiliki nilai interactive time to live (TTL interaktif) di "
"antara job yang tidak bisa dikonfigurasi. Jika kamu tidak menutup batch "
"secara eksplisit, batch akan dinonaktifkan setelah TTL interaktif berakhir "
"dan bisa diaktifkan kembali kapan saja sampai mencapai TTL maksimumnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For instructions to work with these values, see [Run jobs in a "
"batch](/guides/run-jobs-batch).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk instruksi cara bekerja dengan nilai-nilai ini, lihat [Jalankan job "
"dalam batch](/guides/run-jobs-batch).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"session-max-time\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"session-max-time\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Session maximum execution time {#session-maximum-execution-time}"
msgstr "Waktu eksekusi maksimum Session {#session-maximum-execution-time}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When a session is started, it is assigned a maximum TTL value that "
"determines how long a session can run. After this TTL is reached, the "
"session is terminated, any jobs that are already running continue running, "
"and any queued jobs that remain in the session are put into a failed "
"state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ketika sebuah Session dimulai, Session tersebut diberi nilai TTL maksimum "
"yang menentukan berapa lama Session bisa berjalan. Setelah TTL ini tercapai,"
" Session dihentikan, job yang sudah berjalan akan terus berjalan, dan job "
"yang masih antre dalam Session akan dimasukkan ke status gagal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is also an interactive TTL value that cannot be configured.  If no "
"session jobs are queued within that window, the session is temporarily "
"deactivated.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ada juga nilai TTL interaktif yang tidak bisa dikonfigurasi. Jika tidak ada "
"job Session yang diantre dalam jangka waktu tersebut, Session akan "
"dinonaktifkan sementara.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For instructions to work with these values, see [Run jobs in a "
"session](/guides/run-jobs-session).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk instruksi cara bekerja dengan nilai-nilai ini, lihat [Jalankan job "
"dalam session](/guides/run-jobs-session).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Other limitations {#other-limitations}"
msgstr "Batasan lainnya {#other-limitations}"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Inputs to jobs cannot exceed 50MB in size.\n"
msgstr "Input untuk job tidak boleh melebihi 50MB.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On the Open Plan, you can use up to 10 minutes on a QPU per 28-day rolling "
"window. You can view an instance's usage on the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada Open Plan, kamu bisa menggunakan hingga 10 menit pada QPU per jendela "
"bergulir 28 hari. Kamu bisa melihat penggunaan instance di halaman "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

